            "line": 125,
            "text": "theorem affineProfile_partialY {F : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ}\n    (hF : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ F (AxisEvaluation.strip window 20))\n    (b : ℝ → ℝ) (c Λ : ℝ) {p : ℝ × ℝ} (hp : p ∈ domain Λ) :\n    partialY (affineProfile b c Λ F) p = c * Λ * partialY F (rescalePoint Λ p)"
          }
